  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.0.12\n- Proposed observations are assigned to an explainable review role from their classification, cited source kinds, tags, and statement; ambiguous content falls back to Business analyst triage.\n- An assigned role or the coordinator can delegate an observation's accept/reject queue to another role, with an append-only accountable-human audit trail and optional context.\n- CLI, MCP, portal API, and the inline portal review queue expose the same assignment and delegation behavior.",
